  "_note": "The chipsalliance/sv-tests core (generators/black-parrot), pinned at the commit sv-tests pins.  RTL spans THREE repos: black-parrot plus its external/basejump_stl and external/HardFloat submodules -- `submodules: true` is deliberate and must NOT be \"recursive\": basejump_stl's own submodules are DRAMSim3 and ramulator, simulation models this sweep never compiles.  Source list and incdirs were derived from bp_top/syn/flist.vcs (the list sv-tests' generator parses), so roots cover exactly the 286 files it names; HardFloat is .v, everything else .sv.  Configuration goes through `declare_bp_proc_params`, which makes every derived width a struct-FIELD READ of a packed-struct localparam ELEMENT-SELECTED out of all_cfgs_gp, a 128-entry array of ~2700-bit packed structs (~345 kbit).  That folds correctly: a probe of 7 derived params matches read_slang exactly and matches the documented unicore values (cc_x_dim 1, vaddr 39, paddr 40, lce_assoc 8, icache_sets 64).",
